{"unit_id": "kumiiwaka__dsh-intercom#card-zh", "repo": "kumiiwaka/dsh-intercom", "commit": "c92974efe9b82d4be8ca3815ec7546187c189e35", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-intercom（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 会话窗口）：让用户自己打开的多个会话窗口通过文本消息交接信息。它向 DSH 注册四个工具，使用会话控制接口发送消息，并以名称或会话 ID 寻址。主要功能包括登记窗口名称、向目标窗口发送 steer 或 queue 消息、查看近期会话，以及查阅投递记录。它还支持跳数和发送频率限制，并在 steer 不可用时改用 queue。适合需要在已打开的 DSH 窗口间提问、交接结论或传递指令的用户。无需 API Key；可通过环境变量调整宿主数据目录和总线数据目录。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:34-37", "index.js:211-517"]}
{"unit_id": "kumiiwaka__dsh-intercom#card-en", "repo": "kumiiwaka/dsh-intercom", "commit": "c92974efe9b82d4be8ca3815ec7546187c189e35", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-intercom sends text between open DSH session windows. Its four tools register a session name, send by name or ID using steer or queue, list recent sessions, and review deliveries. Steer falls back to queue when unavailable. No API key is needed; environment variables set local data directories.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:34-37", "index.js:211-517"]}
