{"unit_id": "kumiiwaka__dsh-intercom#feature-1", "repo": "kumiiwaka/dsh-intercom", "commit": "c92974efe9b82d4be8ca3815ec7546187c189e35", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "窗口名称登记：调用 bus_register 为当前会话保存一个名称和可选备注，其他窗口随后可用该名称定位会话。会话 ID 可从执行上下文读取，也可显式传入。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:211-299"]}
