{"unit_id": "kumiiwaka__dsh-intercom#caveat-1", "repo": "kumiiwaka/dsh-intercom", "commit": "c92974efe9b82d4be8ca3815ec7546187c189e35", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-intercom 使用前须知：会话登记与投递日志保存在本机总线目录，默认位于 DSH_HOME/window-bus；可用 DSH_WINDOW_BUS_DIR 指定其他位置。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["index.js:34-37", "index.js:47-50", "index.js:70-85"]}
